<title>USA: KCBT deliverable HRW wheat stocks.</title>
<headline>KCBT deliverable HRW wheat stocks.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, MO 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Kansas City Board of Trade reported stocks of hard red winter wheat in deliverable position in exchange approved warehouses as of April 11, in 000 bushels. Note: Deliverable and non-deliverable grades exclude CCC stocks.</p>
<p>					    April 11   WEEK    YEAR</p>
<p>							   AGO     AGO</p>
<p>						   KANSAS CITY AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				  1,711  1,753   9,118</p>
<p>Non-deliverable				119    115     109</p>
<p>CCC					    1,927  1,727   1,306</p>
<p>TOTAL					  3,757  3,595  10,533</p>
<p>						    HUTCHINSON AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				  2,569  2,779    unq</p>
<p>Non-deliverable				220    237    unq</p>
<p>CCC					    2,458  2,658    unq</p>
<p>TOTAL					  5,247  5,674    unq</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
